pathya formal/cubical/ApohaParyaya_WhetherConceptualContentIsNegativeIsWhatTheTwoSchoolsActuallyDispute.agda :: apoha

# ── invariants: they do not move when the file grows ──

niyama machine/naya.kosha :: NAYA => yogya
niyama machine/mula.pramana :: pathya  => ::

