#    regenerated by every engine run, so NO designation can pin it: not a
#    commit, not a path, not a line.  The quotation is carried here and is
#    the object.  The log is named as history only.
#    (The pair originally cited as "lines 146 and 174" no longer stands at
#    those positions, and the refl-typed refusal that was quoted is no
#    longer in the file at all.  The claim it was evidence for survives,
#    and the two lines below are the evidence as it stands.)

uddhrta machine/machine.log 2026-08-20 ::   KERNEL-ACCEPT round=0 x = (xmaxx)  (induction on x, step = cong suc, 4 agda calls)
uddhrta machine/machine.log 2026-08-20 ::   KERNEL-REJECT round=0 x = (xmaxx)  (4 agda calls) [naya=induction on x] kernel gate environment fault
